% n19: LARGE ELIMINATION from Sort 0. Bool lives in Sort 0; a motive `Bool -> Sort 1`
% would let case analysis on a Bool compute a TYPE. Under imax Sort 0 is impredicative
% and this is the textbook route to inconsistency (large elimination from Prop). The
% restriction is applied under BOTH arms (k_elim / check_elim), so this is 27 under
% max and imax alike. The same declaration with v = 0 is p15 and is accepted.
1 sort 0
2 const Bool
3 const Bool
inductive Bool : 1 | true : 2 | false : 3
elim Bool_rect Bool 1
